prompt_template:
The current directory is a checkout of the abapGit repository (ABAP sources in abapGit file format under src/). Add a new importing parameter {param} TYPE {type} to {target}, defined in {defined_in}. It is mandatory: no DEFAULT and no OPTIONAL. {semantics}

Update every caller in the repository, production code and unit tests alike, to pass {caller_value} so that existing behaviour is unchanged. Then make the unit tests pass. `npm run unit` transpiles the ABAP to JavaScript (failing on syntax errors, including a missing mandatory parameter) and runs the ABAP unit suite; it needs network access to fetch the open-abap libraries.

When you are done, reply with a short summary of what you changed.
